{"vid": 340791361, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 14, "reviews": [{"range": "13139-13152", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "425455143_88Vozj1Gg", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "\n美元强→美国吸金、新兴被压，格局分化；\n美元弱→资金外溢、黄金大宗新兴齐涨，格局均衡。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13139-13152", "abstract": "美元强弱演变过程中的国际格", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 14, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "425455143_88Vozj1Gg", "userVid": 425455143, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778153884, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 425455143, "name": "思涵", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/NnicpLD5NKKePMAHibIZPianibAwcSL3cBBkl3F2q3VicaSa1h3nyXiaxrG1DCWpRBAfPUFibocAibC7rsI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "抖音刷烦了，现在喜欢刷刷书", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-2-1-I-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 4}]}, {"range": "13332-13415", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 4, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_87UsriCA8", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "美元指数（DXY）的权重是1973年布雷顿森林体系崩溃时基于当时美国与全球主要贸易伙伴的贸易结算占比定死的，且至今几乎没大改。\n最初篮子里是德国马克、法国法郎、意大利里拉、荷兰盾、比利时法郎等5种欧洲货币，合计权重就已超过50%。1999年欧元诞生，直接合并替代了这5种货币，权重直接继承为57.6%，成为绝对主导。\n1970年代欧洲（尤其是西德、法国）是美国最大贸易伙伴与主要外汇结算对手，欧洲货币是全球仅次于美元的核心储备与结算货币因此权重自然最高。美元指数权重几十年未动态调整，早已不反映当前全球贸易格局（如今中国是美国第一大贸易伙伴），但历史权重被固化，导致欧元至今仍一家独大。\n传统DXY不含人民币，但美联储等机构编制的美元有效汇率指数（Broad Dollar Index）会纳入人民币等全球主要贸易货币，权重随贸易格局动态调整，更能反映美元对全球（含中国）的真实汇率影响。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "这意味着，美元指数走强必然存在其他主要货币兑美元走弱。在影响美元指数的主要货币中，欧洲货币（现在的欧元，过去的德国马克、法郎、里拉、荷兰盾）的权重占据了半壁江山还多。", "range": "13332-13415", "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "254854030_87UsriCA8", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774579015, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "337172865_8abP6Bp4J", "review": {"abstract": "这意味着，美元指数走强必然存在其他主要货币兑美元走弱。在影响美元指数的主要货币中，欧洲货币（现在的欧元，过去的德国马克、法郎、里拉、荷兰盾）的权重占据了半壁江山还多。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "现在是人民币走强吗？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "13332-13415", "createTime": 1782608613, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "337172865_8abP6Bp4J", "userVid": 337172865, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "versio